{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-05-18 10:48:00', 'title': 'S&P/EXPERIAN CONSUMER CREDIT DEFAULT INDICES SHOW DROP IN COMPOSITE RATE IN APRIL 2021', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MAY 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P DOW JONES INDICES AND EXPERIAN RELEASED TODAY DATA THROUGH APRIL 2021 FOR THE S&P/EXPERIAN CONSUMER CREDIT DEFAULT INDICES. THE INDICES REPRESENT A COMPREHENSIVE MEASURE OF CHANGES IN CONSUMER CREDIT DEFAULTS AND SHOW THAT THE COMPOSITE RATE WAS FOUR BASIS POINTS LOWER AT 0.50%.'}